One of our teams sent this over for review. Does it follow the API guidelines? What would you change?

```proto
syntax = "proto3";
package inventory;

service InventoryService {
  rpc getItem(GetItemReq) returns (Item);
  rpc ListItem(ListItemReq) returns (ListItemResp);
  rpc DeleteItemById(DeleteItemReq) returns (Item);
}

enum Status {
  ACTIVE = 0;
  DISCONTINUED = 1;
}

message Item {
  int64 id = 1;
  string item_name = 2;
  Status status = 3;
  bool is_deleted = 4;
}

message ListItemReq { int32 limit = 1; }
message ListItemResp { repeated Item items = 1; }
```
